# 📘 Digital Lab Journal

A web-based Digital Lab Journal developed to digitally manage laboratory experiments and records. This project provides an organized and user-friendly platform for maintaining lab work efficiently.

## ✨ Features
- Digital record management
- Add, update, and delete lab experiments
- Organized experiment history
- Simple and responsive user interface
- Easy navigation and data management

## 🛠️ Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 📌 Project Objective
To replace traditional paper-based lab records with a digital solution that enables students to store, manage, and access laboratory experiments efficiently.

## 🚀 Future Enhancements
- User Login Authentication
- Database Integration
- PDF Report Generation
- Cloud Storage Support

